# Backend scope

- Validate POST bodies with Zod; return `{ ok }` or `{ error }`.
- Session cookies via `jsonWithSession` in `src/lib/auth-response.ts`.
- Prisma client: `@/generated/prisma/client` through `src/lib/prisma.ts`.
- Wrap multi-step writes in `prisma.$transaction`.
- Log governance actions to `AuditLog` and `ActivityEvent`.

